[
    {
        "content": "<p>I've been working on <a href=\"https://github.com/matthunz/circuitlib\">Circuitlib</a>, a digital circuit verification library using category theory for denotational semantics of circuits.</p>\n<p>Combinational circuits are implemented as a <code>SymmetricCategory</code> with morphisms as <code>Monotone</code> functions. I'm hoping to eventually get sequential circuits as a <code>TracedCategory</code> with morphisms as mealy machines but that's still a little way down the road.</p>\n<p>It's been really fun implementing classic circuits, for example here's how to define a half-adder:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">copy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ofNat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">CombinationalCircuit</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟶</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">fork</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⊗ₘ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fork</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≫</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">α_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">hom</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≫</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">◁</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">α_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">inv</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≫</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">◁</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">((</span><span class=\"n\">β_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">hom</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">▷</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≫</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">◁</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">α_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">hom</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≫</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">α_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">inv</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">xor</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ofNat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">CombinationalCircuit</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟶</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">copy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≫</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">and</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⊗ₘ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">or</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≫</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">not</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⊗ₘ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">𝟙</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≫</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">and</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">halfAdder</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ofNat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">CombinationalCircuit</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟶</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">copy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≫</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">xor</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⊗ₘ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">and</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
